        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marysvale%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1869, prospectors discovered Bullion Creek Falls, gold, and an old arrastra, sparking the Bullion Canyon gold rush.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
